# for potez, bod, put, polje, šah, uzimanje, najbolji potez and vraćanje poteza; it is defined anyway,
# so "_acc" is always safe. Numbers 2-4 stay undeclined after prepositions ("nakon dva poteza", "od
# dvije figure"), as usual. There is no instrumental: rephrase. "figura" counts every chessman, pawns
